const editorialCases = {"fairtrade":[["The work behind a useful story","Impact reporting begins long before a finished report. Information lives across CRM records, project updates, content systems, and conversations with the people closest to the work. My role was to help bring those moving pieces together so that teams could communicate with partners more clearly.","The challenge was not simply collecting more information. It was making sure that the right information could be found, understood, and used when a report or content request moved forward."],["From scattered inputs to shared context","I supported annual and baseline reporting workflows using Salesforce, Asana, and Contentful. That meant coordinating details across teams, tracking updates, and helping keep content and reporting material organized.","One concrete part of the work was a centralized content library covering six industry sectors. A library earns its place when the next person can find relevant material without reconstructing the project from scratch. Organizing by sector and keeping useful context close to the content helps teams move from searching to making decisions."],["Working across partners and perspectives","The work involved client-facing reporting and content for partners including Walmart, Target, Costco, Hershey’s, and Amazon. It also meant working with data teams, producer representatives, and other stakeholders to check information and coordinate deliverables.","These conversations are part of the work, not a detour from it. The same data can mean different things to different readers; a useful report needs to respect both the details and the audience."],["What I carry forward","Good operations make a story easier to tell. A clear source, a visible owner, and a dependable place to find the latest material help a team spend less energy untangling information and more energy communicating its meaning."]],"creatordeck":[["The right creator is more than a number","Influencer marketing can look simple from the outside: choose a creator, publish content, and report performance. The work behind a campaign is more involved. Audience fit, creative alignment, communication, and deadlines all have to connect.","At Creator Deck, I supported campaigns for beauty and fragrance brands by helping organize the research and coordination behind those partnerships."],["Research with a purpose","I researched and vetted creators using audience demographics, engagement rates, and campaign KPIs. A creator’s reach was one part of the picture; the audience and the context of a campaign mattered too.","For example, creator research could bring audience information and engagement indicators into one place for a team reviewing potential partners. The point was to help the team make a more informed match, rather than treat a single metric as the whole story."],["Keeping the details moving","I maintained creator databases, supported outreach and coordination, tracked deliverables, and prepared performance reports. The work connected the earlier research to what happened after a creator was selected.","The brands across this experience included YSL, Sephora, Redken, IT Cosmetics, Kylie Cosmetics, L’Oréal, Flower Knows, and Azzaro. Each campaign had its own context and requirements; my focus was helping the operational details stay organized."],["What I carry forward","The best process supports the relationship. Clear information and reliable follow-through give creative teams and partners more room to focus on the work people will actually see."]],"lihtc":[["A community is more than an audience","Affordable housing brings together developers, lenders, investors, employers, and professionals who need relevant information at the right time. LIHTC Leaders connects people across that space through community content and a specialized job board.","My work supports both sides: keeping community communications moving and helping employers navigate opportunities to reach professionals in the field."],["The work behind the connection","I manage company and employee LinkedIn profiles, coordinate employer outreach, support job listings, and maintain CRM records. The profiles I manage have a combined audience of more than 21,000, as reported in my profile.","For example, supporting a role can involve organizing employer details, helping with the listing, sharing relevant content, and tracking follow-up. Each step matters because a useful connection depends on information staying accurate and available."],["Relationships and reporting","My work has involved organizations including Wells Fargo, April Housing, Dominium, Pennrose, and Fairstead. Relationships and responsibilities vary, from community and outreach activity to employer and job-board support.","I also monitor job-posting performance and keep records that help the team see what needs attention. A view or a click is useful when it is understood in context: which role, what period, and what the team needs to do next."],["What I carry forward","Community management is an operational discipline as much as a communication skill. Consistent records, thoughtful follow-through, and a clear understanding of the audience make it easier to connect people with the right opportunity."]],"feishu":[["Localization starts with listening","A message can be grammatically correct and still feel unfamiliar to its audience. Localization asks a broader question: would the words, references, and context make sense to the people they are intended to reach?","As a U.S. Marketing Localization Assistant, I help review marketing language and organize recommendations for American audiences."],["Research before rewriting","I review landing pages, product descriptions, and promotional materials for natural U.S. English and audience fit. I also research consumer conversations on Reddit, TikTok, and YouTube to understand how people describe their concerns and choices.","Rather than relying on a single phrase in isolation, I look for useful context: what question a potential customer is asking, how competitors explain a product, and where a message might need more clarity."],["Turning observations into action","I maintain trackers with suggested copy revisions, competitor messaging examples, and recommendations. For a team working across languages and markets, those notes make the reasoning behind a suggestion easier to find and discuss.","A clear recommendation needs enough context for another person to use it: the original wording, the proposed change, and the audience consideration behind it."],["What I carry forward","Thoughtful localization is a combination of curiosity, empathy, and operational clarity. The goal is to help a message feel understandable and relevant to the people receiving it."]]};
const casePlaybooks = {"fairtrade":["A useful handoff has a purpose","A reporting workflow is easier to navigate when the team can identify the source, the owner, and the next review. For partner-facing work, those details help people distinguish an update that is ready to use from one that still needs a question answered.","For example, a content library organized by sector can give someone preparing a report a more practical starting point: relevant material and the context around it. The value is in making the next step clearer, not in making the library larger."],"creatordeck":["A creator match is a set of decisions","Audience demographics, engagement, and campaign goals become more useful when viewed together. They help a team consider whether a creator is relevant to a particular brief and which questions should be answered before moving forward.","Coordination then turns research into action: keep the creator information accessible, track expected deliverables, and make reporting requirements visible. Those details support the relationship throughout the campaign."],"lihtc":["A listing is part of a larger relationship","Employer outreach, listing support, and community communication are connected. An organized record helps a team understand the employer, the role, the status of a follow-up, and what information should be shared next.","Reporting gives that conversation another dimension. When reviewing job-posting views or clicks, the useful context includes the role and the period being considered. Those details make it easier to discuss performance without assigning a result to the wrong cause."],"feishu":["Make the reasoning easy to review","A suggested revision is more useful when the team can see the original wording, the proposed alternative, and the audience consideration behind it. A tracker gives those pieces a common place to live.","Consumer discussion and competitor examples can help identify questions worth considering. They are inputs to judgment, not a substitute for understanding the product or the audience."]};
const $=selector=>document.querySelector(selector);
const menu=$('.mobile-menu'); const toggle=$('.menu-toggle');
toggle.addEventListener('click',()=>{const open=toggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true';toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!open));toggle.setAttribute('aria-label',open?'Open navigation':'Close navigation');menu.hidden=open;});
menu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link=>link.addEventListener('click',()=>{menu.hidden=true;toggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');toggle.setAttribute('aria-label','Open navigation');}));
let current='fairtrade'; let scenes=null;
function selectMission(key){
  const m=missions[key];if(!m)return;current=key;
  document.querySelectorAll('.mission-tab').forEach(button=>{const active=button.dataset.mission===key;button.id='mission-tab-'+button.dataset.mission;button.classList.toggle('active',active);button.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(active));button.tabIndex=active?0:-1;});
  $('#mission-panel').setAttribute('aria-labelledby','mission-tab-'+key);$('#planet-stage').dataset.palette=String(m.palette);$('#mission-code').textContent=m.code;$('#planet-short').textContent=m.short;$('#mission-category').textContent=m.category;$('#mission-figure').textContent=m.number;$('#mission-number').textContent=m.number+' / 04';$('#mission-org').textContent=m.org;$('#mission-title').innerHTML=m.title;$('#mission-description').textContent=m.description;$('#mission-period').textContent=m.period;
  $('#mission-tags').replaceChildren(...m.tags.map(tag=>{const el=document.createElement('span');el.textContent=tag;return el;}));
  if(scenes) scenes.setMission(m.palette);
}
document.querySelectorAll('.mission-tab').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>selectMission(button.dataset.mission)));
document.querySelectorAll('[data-mission-link]').forEach(link=>link.addEventListener('click',()=>selectMission(link.dataset.missionLink)));
function selectCapability(key){const item=capabilities[key];if(!item)return;document.querySelectorAll('.cap-item').forEach(button=>{const active=button.dataset.cap===key;button.classList.toggle('active',active);button.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(active));button.tabIndex=active?0:-1;});$('#cap-label').textContent='SELECTED CAPABILITY / '+item.number;$('#cap-description').textContent=item.text;$('#cap-tools').textContent=item.tools;if(scenes)scenes.setCapability(Number(item.number)-1);}
document.querySelectorAll('.cap-item').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>selectCapability(button.dataset.cap)));
function enableTabKeys(selector){const tabs=[...document.querySelectorAll(selector)];tabs.forEach((tab,i)=>tab.addEventListener('keydown',event=>{let next=i;if(event.key==='ArrowRight'||event.key==='ArrowDown')next=(i+1)%tabs.length;else if(event.key==='ArrowLeft'||event.key==='ArrowUp')next=(i-1+tabs.length)%tabs.length;else if(event.key==='Home')next=0;else if(event.key==='End')next=tabs.length-1;else return;event.preventDefault();tabs[next].click();tabs[next].focus();}));}
enableTabKeys('.mission-tab');enableTabKeys('.cap-item');selectMission(current);selectCapability('operations');
const dialog=$('#mission-dialog');
$('#mission-detail').addEventListener('click',()=>{const m=missions[current],detail=caseDetails[current];$('#dialog-index').textContent=m.number;$('#case-visual-index').textContent=m.number+' / 04';$('#case-visual').dataset.case=current;$('#dialog-org').textContent=m.org;$('#dialog-title').textContent=m.plainTitle;$('#dialog-intro').textContent=m.intro;$('#dialog-context').textContent=m.context;$('#dialog-challenge').textContent=detail.challenge;$('#dialog-approach').textContent=detail.approach;$('#dialog-outcome').textContent=detail.outcome;$('#dialog-tools').textContent=m.tools;const story=$('#case-story');story.replaceChildren(...[...editorialCases[current].slice(0,-1),casePlaybooks[current],...editorialCases[current].slice(-1)].map(([heading,...paragraphs])=>{const section=document.createElement('section');const h=document.createElement('h3');h.textContent=heading;section.append(h,...paragraphs.map(text=>{const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=text;return p;}));return section;}));dialog.scrollTop=0;$('#dialog-bullets').replaceChildren(...m.bullets.map(b=>{const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=b;return li;}));$('#case-flow').replaceChildren(...detail.flow.map((item,i)=>{const node=document.createElement('div');node.className='flow-node';const count=document.createElement('span');count.textContent='0'+(i+1);const label=document.createElement('strong');label.textContent=item;node.append(count,label);return node;}));dialog.showModal();});
$('#dialog-close').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());$('#dialog-bottom-close').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target===dialog)dialog.close();});
const quick=$('#quick-dialog');$('#quick-open').addEventListener('click',()=>quick.showModal());$('#quick-close').addEventListener('click',()=>quick.close());$('#quick-work').addEventListener('click',()=>quick.close());$('#quick-gallery').addEventListener('click',()=>quick.close());quick.addEventListener('click',event=>{if(event.target===quick)quick.close();});
// Keep the narrative and controls available even on browsers that cannot start WebGL.
import('./scenes.bundle.js?v=3').then(module=>{scenes=module.initScenes({onMissionSelect:index=>selectMission(['fairtrade','creatordeck','lihtc','feishu'][index])});scenes.setMission(missions[current].palette);const active=document.querySelector('.cap-item.active');scenes.setCapability(Number(capabilities[active.dataset.cap].number)-1);}).catch(error=>{document.documentElement.classList.add('no-webgl');$('.drag-hint').textContent='CHOOSE A WORLD TO EXPLORE';console.warn('Space scenes unavailable:',error);});
